  "description": "This library provides a set of robust utility functions for executing SQL stored procedures with ease. It includes both synchronous and asynchronous methods to meet various application needs, such as:\n\nExecuteDataset / ExecuteDatasetAsync: Executes a stored procedure and returns a DataSet.\nExecuteNonQueryTypedParams / ExecuteNonQueryTypedParamsAsync: Executes a stored procedure with strongly-typed parameters and returns the number of rows affected.\nAdditionally, the library offers convenient methods to convert DataSet objects into strongly-typed lists or class objects, improving code readability and reducing boilerplate conversion logic.\nConvertDataSetToDictionary, ConvertDataTableToDictionary",
  "iconFile": "SLQCSharpICon.png",
